---
title: Moscow Mule
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, vodka]
source: Classic cocktail, number 16 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Fill a #copper mug{} with ice. Pour in @vodka{2%fl_oz} and @lime juice{0.5%fl_oz}, top with @ginger beer{4%fl_oz}, and stir gently. Garnish with a @lime{1%wedge}.

> A spicy, dry ginger beer is better than a sweet one.
